        <mxCell id="legend" value="UML: solid line = association; dashed open arrow = DTO/entity usage dependency; dashed hollow triangle = realization.&lt;br&gt;Only backend classes use constructor DI. Frontend classes have ordinary references. HTTPS labels denote remote communication. Each transition class maps exactly one transition ID; final/choice handlers introduce no persisted business status." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=16;">
